# Design System & Component Standards
## Stack
React 18+ with TypeScript, Bun as package manager, Tailwind CSS for styling.
## Visuals
Minimalist UI/UX. Use neutral tones with a stark, high-contrast accent color (e.g., neon green) for the live token reduction counter.
## Code Style
Use functional components with hooks only. Extract reusable logic into custom hooks.